  "_comment": "The shipped iOS decoder's exact expectations, transcribed from takeshape-mobile/LidarAI/HomeAIChatView.swift (HomeAIChatResponse and friends, lines 13-261 at vendored commit 8f2eb5a). Swift's Codable hard-fails the WHOLE response on a missing non-optional key, a null where a value is expected, or an enum value outside the closed set — so this file is the additivity contract: the server may add fields, but everything here must decode forever.",
